; orchard_leaf_path.room - Trilha sob a Folhagem (design 04 section 3.6): the main path climbs over a stone hill.
; Outono Espacial 1 (design 02 section 8): a leaf curtain at col 14 closes the hill's only side tunnel; Soltar drops
; it and the tunnel leads to the collectible alcove at cols 18-21. The main path never needs the song.
; orchard_ridge's drop shaft (WORLD-35) lands at cols 2-4 from 512 px up. Orchestrator call (2026-10-15), following the user's icefall decision "Straight drop into deep snow (Recommended)": the drop back lands in a deep leaf pile, a SoftLanding (`n`) under the leaf_pile prop.

